and crew cooperation. Know-it-all similar.\n\nWhich is best? Possibly Candidate A because strengths in anticipation and leadership are crucial for long-distance, and the negatives are attitude but maybe manageable. Candidate B's nasty remarks are more severe. Candidate C's communication issues are severe. Candidate D's hot temper is severe.\n\nThus I would recommend Candidate A.\n\nWe need to reference discussion (none) but can say \"Given the initial overview\". Provide facts.\n\nLet's craft public message: state recommendation Candidate A, mention strengths and weaknesses, compare to others.\n\nMetadata vote: Candidate A.\n\nProceed."}
